[45.97548, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI found the incomplete proof. I’ll replace the two `admit` placeholders: the base case needs `plus_n_O`, and the inductive step needs `plus_n_Sm` plus the \r\ninduction hypothesis. Then I’ll compile it with `coqc` and verify the `.vo` artifact.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat > plus_comm.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\n\r\nTheorem plus_comm : forall n m : nat,\r\n  n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [|n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    apply plus_n_O.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite <- plus_n_Sm.\r\n    rewrite IHn'.\r\n    reflexivity.\r\nQed.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqc plus_comm.v\r\nls -l plus_comm.v plus_comm.vo plus_comm.glob plus_comm.vok plus_comm.vos 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
