[50.279607, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe proof compiles successfully and `plus_comm.vo` was generated. Let me perform a final integrity check by confirming there are no `admit`s and validating the \r\ncompiled module with `coqchk`.\r\n\r\n```\r\ngrep -n 'admit\\|Abort' plus_comm.v || true\r\ncoqchk -silent plus_comm && echo 'coqchk: OK'\r\nnl -ba plus_comm.v\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
